    "protos/protos.d.ts": "build/protos/protos.d.ts importing protobufjs and Long types from vgoogle-gax and vlong, with Buffer resolved only where Node types are loaded.",
    "lib/services.js": "Method kinds, routing rules, page fields, long-running types and path templates from the generated clients, as data.",
    "lib/client.js": "One shared implementation of the generated client constructor, initialization, call wrappers, path helpers and operations helpers.",
    "v1/index.d.ts": "Generated by scripts/build-firestore-api.cjs from lib/services.js and protos/protos.json."
  },
  "changes": [
    "One transport stack: vgoogle-gax is the default gax instance; no nested gax, grpc-js or protobufjs copies.",
    "Importing loads three modules. Clients load on first access and the 1.3 MB static protos module only when protos is read.",
    "Loaded protos and the parsed root are cached per gax module and JSON object instead of hashing the serialized JSON on each construction.",
    "Routing headers are added to a copy of the call options; the caller's options object is not modified.",
    "A routed field under a missing parent message routes as empty instead of throwing a TypeError synchronously.",
    "A failed stub rejects the calls that need it without also raising an unhandled rejection.",
    "close() waits for the locations and operations clients and rejects if they fail to close.",
    "Server streams opened after close() starts fail at once instead of after two no-response retries.",
    "getOperation, cancelOperation, deleteOperation and listOperationsAsync accept a missing request.",
    "Status details are decoded for long-running and paged calls as well as unary calls, and details this service cannot decode are kept.",
    "Path builders name a missing argument instead of failing inside the template."
  ]
